    ///
    /// # Examples
    /// ```json
    /// {"id":"5f0c2b9e-8c1a-4d3e-9b7f-2a6d1e4c8b90","label":"screen/01 Sign in","updated_at":1727000030000}
    /// ```
    ///
    /// Write (`mutating`): sent with `execute`.
    ///
    /// - Parameters:
    ///   - id: the element to rename.
    ///   - label: a `/`-separated path, groups first (`"topbar/logo"`); a `rect` labelled `screen/<name>` is a presentation screen. Keep any U+001F suffix the current label carries. `null` clears the label.
