    /// than 200 entries.
    ///
    /// # Examples
    /// ```json
    /// {"labels":[{"id":"5f0c2b9e-8c1a-4d3e-9b7f-2a6d1e4c8b90","label":"topbar/logo"}],"updated_at":1727000030000}
    /// ```
    ///
    /// Write (`mutating`): sent with `execute`.
    ///
    /// - Parameters:
    ///   - labels: at most 200; each names an element and its new label, or `null` to clear it.
